@startuml
skinparam linetype ortho
autonumber

actor "Usuário" as User
participant "Frontend\n(React)" as Front
participant "TestController\n(Node.js)" as Core
participant "ProviderFactory\n(Service)" as Factory
participant "Banco de Dados" as DB

User -> Front: 1: Define Parâmetros (API, Usuários)
activate Front
Front -> Core: 2: POST /configurar
activate Core

group Validação de Estratégia
    Core -> Factory: 3: validarCompatibilidade(api_tipo)
    activate Factory
    Factory --> Core: 4: true (Driver disponível)
    deactivate Factory
end

Core -> DB: 5: INSERT Teste (Status: CONFIGURADO)
activate DB
DB --> Core: 6: UUID Gerado
deactivate DB

Core --> Front: 7: 201 Created (Teste ID)
deactivate Core
Front --> User: 8: Exibe confirmação
deactivate Front
@enduml